## AI Transaction Workflow

The AI feature is designed to assist users rather than make unverified financial decisions.

Example:

```text
User uploads invoice
        ↓
File validation
        ↓
Private storage
        ↓
AI extraction
        ↓
Schema validation
        ↓
Business-rule validation
        ↓
Transaction draft
        ↓
User reviews information
        ↓
User confirms
        ↓
Transaction saved
```

The user should be able to correct:

* Amount
* Date
* Vendor/customer
* Category
* Transaction type
* Description
* Currency

before the transaction becomes an official financial record.

